4. SCALING DIAGNOSTICS FOR s_N = (kappa*N)^2 * (D_0 / D_1)
================================================================================
Connection between Part 3 and Part 4 via the subexponential decomposition:
    log(s_N) = 2*log(kappa*N) - [-log|D_1| + log|D_0|] = 2*log(kappa*N) - Delta_N
where Delta_N = -log|D_0| + log|D_1| removes the leading exponential order.

